meta {
  name: Get Mentors List
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/mentors
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # Get Mentors List
  List active approved mentors with expertise tags, bio, and availability.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - List of approved mentors returned.
  - `401` - Unauthorized.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  [
    {
      "id": "usr_mentor_1",
      "name": "Dr. Ramesh Sundaram",
      "title": "Senior FinTech Advisor",
      "expertise": [
        "FinTech",
        "Regulatory Compliance",
        "Scale-up"
      ],
      "rating": 4.9,
      "sessionsCompleted": 42
    }
  ]
  ```
}
